<title>TURKEY: Turkish wholesale prices up 5.1 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Turkish wholesale prices up 5.1 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish wholesale prices rose by 5.1 percent in November compared with the previous month, after a 5.5 percent mmonth-on-month gain in October, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said consumer prices rose 5.2 percent last month, down from 6.5 percent in October.  </p>
<p>The year-on-year wholesale inflation rise was 85.7 percent in November, up from 82.8 percent in October.</p>
<p>Year-on-year consumer price inflation rose to 80.4 percent last from 79.6 percent in October.</p>
<p>TURKISH PRICES			  Nov96  Oct96  Nov95  Dec95</p>
<p> Consumer mo/mo pct change	    5.2    6.5    4.7    3.8</p>
<p> Consumer yr/yr			  80.4   79.6   81.5   76.0</p>
<p> Consmuer index (1994=100)	  416.5  396.0  230.9  239.6</p>
<p> Wholesale mo/mo			  5.1    5.5    3.5    4.3</p>
<p> Wholesale yr/yr			 85.7   82.8   68.9   65.6</p>
<p> Wholesale index(1994=100)	  396.9  377.6  213.7  223.1</p>
<p>-- Ankara newsroom, 90-312-446 2940</p>
